I am sitting comfortably on the sofa.
My stomach is full.
I am taking my phone.
I am making a video call.
I am calling my sister Sofia.
Sofia answers the call.
"Hello Maya, are you okay?" Sofia asks.
"I am fine," I say.
I am looking at the phone's screen.
Our dog Lola is on the screen.
Lola is at the house in Mexico.
She is lying on the floor.
She is sleeping heavily.
"Lola is sleeping," Sofia says.
I am laughing.
We talk for a long time.
I am very happy now.
